my $CODE = <<'END_CODE';
line one
line two
line three
END_CODE

{
    desc => q{u undoes a 2dd (counted line delete)},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
## Macro: `xt/visual/macros/undo_2dd`

Tests that **u** restores two lines deleted by **2dd** as a single undo unit.

**Keys:** `2dd`, `u`

**initial.png**
- Buffer has 3 lines: "line one", "line two", "line three"
- Cursor on line 1

**after_2dd.png**
- Buffer has 1 line: "line three"
- First two lines deleted by 2dd
- Intermediate snapshot showing the changed state

**after_undo.png**
- Buffer restored to 3 lines (identical to initial)
- Both deleted lines restored in one undo step
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('2dd');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_2dd');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('u');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_undo');
    },
}
